}

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// HOW A LINE RUNS (the pattern). Each line on the sheet gets one, picked from its name the first time and remembered.
//   night     runs overnight (Breading: about 6 PM to 4 AM, so a 10 h run is the whole night)
//   dayclean  runs through the day and is cleaned at night (WJ, IBL 5): the window ends when the night clean starts
//   nonstop   runs around the clock for days (IBL 4): every day is a full 24 h window, runs flow into each other
