// The sheet's notes go with the runs they are about (saved in the run's Notes column):
//   a note in an item's cell for a day  -> that item's run that day; else its nearest earlier run ("hold and test" the day after a run), else the next one
//   a note on the item itself (its row, or a Notes column) -> every run of that item on the sheet
//   a note under a day with no item     -> every run on that line that day; else the line's nearest run
